1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,760
“爬公司梯子的人，没一个开心。”
“No one who climbs the corporate ladder is happy.”

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:04,974
说这话的 Tim Denning，简介自称
That's Tim Denning, whose bio claims 1B+ views

3
00:00:04,994 --> 00:00:07,670
10 亿阅读，自述银行干了十年。
and who says he spent ten years in banking.

4
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:08,986
Tim 说，为这事专门
Tim says he asked general

5
00:00:09,006 --> 00:00:10,500
问过总经理和 CEO。
managers and CEOs about it.

6
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:12,950
多数人的答案：希望当初没爬。
Most of them said: I wish I hadn't climbed.

7
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:14,615
可爬久了，退不回去：
But after a while there's no going back:

8
00:00:14,635 --> 00:00:16,830
习惯了那份钱和地位。
you get used to the money and status.

9
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:19,213
第十条：每天 8 小时给无聊的工作，
Lesson 10: if a boring job gets 8 hours,

10
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:21,040
就留 1 小时早晨给自己。
keep one morning hour for yourself.

11
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,586
理想的生活，是在上班前
The life you dream of is built

12
00:00:22,606 --> 00:00:24,030
和下班后建起来的。
before and after work.

13
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:25,530
不会有更闲、更有钱、
There's no day when you're less busy,

14
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:26,730
更懂行的那一天。
richer or wiser.

15
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,080
不开始，就永远不会开始。
Don't start now and you never will.

16
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,743
第三十四条：多数公司
Lesson 34: most workplaces

17
00:00:30,763 --> 00:00:32,420
是成年人的托儿所。
are adult daycare centers.

18
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:35,118
亲人去世，公司会说抱歉、放你假；
If a relative dies, work apologizes and gives time off.

19
00:00:35,138 --> 00:00:37,490
真实世界没人管，照常上班。
The real world expects you to show up.

20
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:38,558
裁员文化也一样：
Layoff culture too:

21
00:00:38,578 --> 00:00:40,027
上一分钟“送上祝福”，
one minute 'thoughts and prayers',

22
00:00:40,047 --> 00:00:42,180
下一分钟“你被解雇了”。
the next 'you've been let go'.

23
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:44,633
第三十五条：靠融资做独角兽，
Lesson 35: building a unicorn on VC money

24
00:00:44,653 --> 00:00:46,390
是最蠢的幻想之一。
is one of the stupidest fantasies.

25
00:00:46,410 --> 00:00:48,835
新世界不用融资、不用买广告：免费
Today you need no funding or ads:

26
00:00:48,855 --> 00:00:51,830
社交媒体攒个邮件列表，就能开张。
build an email list on free social media and launch.

27
00:00:51,850 --> 00:00:54,087
第十五条：隐身，换个昵称，
Lesson 15: disappear, take a nickname,

28
00:00:54,107 --> 00:00:55,830
再放手去网上做事。
then build online without fear.

29
00:00:55,850 --> 00:00:57,454
括号里 Tim 还开了个玩笑：
In brackets Tim jokes

30
00:00:57,474 --> 00:00:59,800
今后改叫 Tim Winterbottom。
that from here on he goes by Tim Winterbottom.

31
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:01,872
别忘了，劝人离开公司的 Tim，
Remember: Tim, who urges people to leave their jobs,

32
00:01:01,892 --> 00:01:03,910
自己的生意就在网上。
runs his own business online.

33
00:01:03,930 --> 00:01:05,430
头衔是公司给的，
Titles are handed out by the company.

34
00:01:05,450 --> 00:01:07,330
自由得自己挣。
Freedom you have to earn yourself.
